
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About us";
    ViewData["BodyClass"] = "page-info page-about";
}

<header class="page-head">
    <p class="eyebrow">About AkeaEvents</p>
    <h1>Creating beautiful moments, one event at a time</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">
        At AkeaEvents, we help bring your event vision to life through thoughtfully planned décor and event styling.
        Whether you're planning a special celebration or a memorable gathering, our goal is to help you create an
        atmosphere that reflects your style and makes your occasion unforgettable.
    </p>
</header>

<div class="about-page">
    <p class="about-intro">
        We believe every event deserves attention to detail, careful preparation, and a décor setup that brings people together.
    </p>

    <section class="about-block" aria-labelledby="whoTitle">
        <h2 id="whoTitle">Who we are</h2>
        <p>
            AkeaEvents is an event décor business managed by a dedicated team passionate about helping clients bring
            their ideas to life. From selecting the right décor elements to coordinating the details of your event,
            we work with you to understand your needs and create a setup suited to your occasion.
        </p>
        <p>
            Our services can include décor furniture, chairs, tables, tents, floral arrangements, and complete event
            décor solutions tailored to your requirements.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-block" aria-labelledby="missionTitle">
        <h2 id="missionTitle">Our mission</h2>
        <p>
            Our mission is to make the event décor planning process simpler and more convenient for our clients,
            while helping them explore creative possibilities for their special occasions.
        </p>
        <p>
            We aim to provide a clear starting point for your planning journey, allowing you to explore previous
            work, consider available options, and estimate costs before making an enquiry.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-block" aria-labelledby="easierTitle">
        <h2 id="easierTitle">Making event planning easier</h2>
        <p>
            Planning an event involves many decisions. We want to make the décor process easier by giving you
            the tools to explore your options at your own pace.
        </p>

        <ul class="about-features">
            <li class="about-feature">
                <h3>Explore our portfolio</h3>
                <p>Browse previous décor projects to discover styles and ideas that inspire you.</p>
                <a asp-controller="Portfolio" asp-action="Index">View our work &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li class="about-feature">
                <h3>Estimate your costs</h3>
                <p>Use our self-service estimator to see an estimated cost based on your event requirements.</p>
                <a asp-controller="Catalogue" asp-action="Products">Start an estimate &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li class="about-feature">
                <h3>Make an enquiry</h3>
                <p>Tell us about your event and the services you are interested in.</p>
                <a asp-controller="Enquiries" asp-action="Index">Send an enquiry &rarr;</a>
            </li>
            <li class="about-feature">
                <h3>Plan with confidence</h3>
                <p>Use the information on our website to decide which options suit your needs and budget.</p>
                <a asp-controller="Catalogue" asp-action="Packages">See our packages &rarr;</a>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="about-block" aria-labelledby="approachTitle">
        <h2 id="approachTitle">Our approach</h2>
        <p>
            Every event begins with an idea. We focus on understanding your requirements, considering the details
            that matter, and working with you as your plans take shape.
        </p>
        <p>
            From your initial enquiry to the confirmation of your décor arrangements, we aim to make communication
            clearer and the planning process more organised.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-cta" aria-labelledby="ctaTitle">
        <h2 id="ctaTitle">Let's bring your vision to life</h2>
        <p>
            Have an event in mind? Explore our portfolio, try our cost estimator, or send us an enquiry to take
            the next step towards your event.
        </p>
        <div class="btn-row">
            <a asp-controller="Portfolio" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Explore our portfolio</a>
            <a asp-controller="Catalogue" asp-action="Products" class="btn btn-dark">Get an instant estimate</a>
            <a asp-controller="Enquiries" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Send an enquiry</a>
        </div>
        <p class="about-tagline">Your vision. Your occasion. Let's make it memorable.</p>
    </section>
</div>